      "value": "@{5d0dcfdfcf358714c3295891|full_name}: If it's disabled by default, then yeah, I guess it's possible!\nNo developer wants to add a performance destroying feature though! But I totally agree it'd be a great idea, I just don't think Dynamic Bones is the way to go for it, but I don't have another solution instead of it. :)",
